{"id":"ha_bito","lemma":"hábito","pos":"noun","rank":3651,"glosses":["habit, custom","habit (of a monk)","military rank"],"ipa":"/ˈabito/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"hábitos"},"order":3654,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-h%C3%A1bito.wav","examples":[{"text":"Fumar es un hábito asqueroso.","en":"Smoking is a disgusting habit.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803541","words":[{"g":"to smoke"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"disgusting"}]},{"text":"Ese es un hábito que desearía dejar.","en":"That's a habit that I wish I could break.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to wish","l":"desear"},{"g":"to leave"}]},{"text":"Tengo el hábito de caminar cada día.","en":"I'm in the habit of taking a walk every day.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to walk"},{"g":"each"},{"g":"day"}]}]}